Ported files are listed below as they are added, with the original file
they come from. Each ported file keeps a header naming its origin.

  src/tmux/gateway.ts        <- src/tmuxGateway.ts
  src/tmux/controlClient.ts  <- src/tmuxControlClient.ts (typed operations), with
                                parts of src/extension.ts, src/tmuxTerminalProvider.ts
                                and src/windowTitle.ts
  src/tmux/sendKeys.ts       <- src/tmuxTerminalProvider.ts (send-keys input encoding)
  src/tmux/windowTitle.ts    <- src/windowTitle.ts
  src/tmux/paneOutput.ts     <- src/tmuxTerminalProvider.ts (normalizeTerminalOutput)

The build setup (webpack configuration) is modelled on tabby-tmux
